{"lines": [{"text": "Your phone unlocks the moment it sees your face.", "start": 0.3, "end": 2.853}, {"text": "So why can't a photo of you do the same?", "start": 3.003, "end": 5.0}, {"text": "Above the screen, a tiny projector fires more than thirty thousand invisible dots of infrared light.", "start": 5.4, "end": 11.681}, {"text": "Those dots land on your nose, your cheeks, your brow.", "start": 12.031, "end": 14.911}, {"text": "An infrared camera reads where every dot lands, and builds a 3D depth map of your face.", "start": 15.211, "end": 20.903}, {"text": "A photo is flat. It has no depth, so it can't pass.", "start": 21.253, "end": 24.412}, {"text": "And the matching happens on the phone itself, not in the cloud.", "start": 24.762, "end": 28.209}, {"text": "The odds a random stranger unlocks it? Less than one in a million.", "start": 28.559, "end": 32.554}], "total": 32.554, "words": [{"w": "Your", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.555, "line": 0}, {"w": "phone", "s": 0.555, "e": 0.857, "line": 0}, {"w": "unlocks", "s": 0.857, "e": 1.252, "line": 0}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.252, "e": 1.46, "line": 0}, {"w": "moment", "s": 1.46, "e": 1.809, "line": 0}, {"w": "it", "s": 1.809, "e": 1.971, "line": 0}, {"w": "sees", "s": 1.971, "e": 2.226, "line": 0}, {"w": "your", "s": 2.226, "e": 2.482, "line": 0}, {"w": "face.", "s": 2.482, "e": 2.853, "line": 0}, {"w": "So", "s": 3.003, "e": 3.162, "line": 1}, {"w": "why", "s": 3.162, "e": 3.366, "line": 1}, {"w": "can't", "s": 3.366, "e": 3.616, "line": 1}, {"w": "a", "s": 3.616, "e": 3.729, "line": 1}, {"w": "photo", "s": 3.729, "e": 4.024, "line": 1}, {"w": "of", "s": 4.024, "e": 4.183, "line": 1}, {"w": "you", "s": 4.183, "e": 4.387, "line": 1}, {"w": "do", "s": 4.387, "e": 4.546, "line": 1}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.546, "e": 4.75, "line": 1}, {"w": "same?", "s": 4.75, "e": 5.0, "line": 1}, {"w": "Above", "s": 5.4, "e": 5.765, "line": 2}, {"w": "the", "s": 5.765, "e": 6.017, "line": 2}, {"w": "screen,", "s": 6.017, "e": 6.578, "line": 2}, {"w": "a